AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000146 "The posterior probability, derived from a Gaussian Mixture Model (GMM) Classification, that a given patch encounter represents an 'exploitation' event (i.e., the worm has accepted the patch and is consuming bacteria). This value ranges from 0 to 1. [Source: https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.103191.2.sa4]")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000146 "C. elegans behavioral assay: posterior probability of exploitation"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:EMPTY_0000146 obo:EMPTY_0000100)
SubClassOf(obo:EMPTY_0000146 obo:NCIT_C54154)

# Class: obo:EMPTY_0000147 (C. elegans behavioral assay: posterior probability of sensing)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000147 "The posterior probability, derived from a semi-supervised Quadratic Discriminant Analysis (QDA), that a given patch encounter was 'sensed' by the C. elegans worm (i.e., the animal detected the presence of bacteria, typically indicated by a slowdown). This value ranges from 0 to 1. [Source: https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.103191.2.sa4]")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000147 "C. elegans behavioral assay: posterior probability of sensing"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:EMPTY_0000147 obo:EMPTY_0000100)
